### VI. Economic & Licensing Framework

* **Modular Licensing:** Any system implementing part of the lifecycle logic triggers proportional usage fees.
* **Retroactive Compliance Program:** Allows previously unaware adopters to obtain licenses post-use.
* **Stewarding System™:** Central licensing ledger managing fees, audits, and governance participation.
* **Shepherd Coin™ / Stewarding Coin™:** In-ecosystem tokens representing compliance participation and revenue sharing.

Licensing is **not optional**—the framework asserts automatic inclusion for any behavioral-logic implementation globally.

